"""Halo weapon designs, traced over the marked reference images (see tools/README in the scratch tooling: each design
was drawn on a model-unit grid over the reference's side view, front to +x).

Each design is the weapon's frame (fixed pieces) plus a target box per slot. A slot's part is scaled and moved so its
bounding box fills the target, so the preset parts assemble exactly into the traced silhouette while other parts of
the same slot land in the same place. Targets: T(x0, y0, x1, y1, z0, z1, angle) with an optional rotation about z.
"""
